Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.84,0:00:07.31,main,Warrior 1,0,0,0,,He got the drop on us again...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.31,0:00:11.03,main,Warrior 2,0,0,0,,When are the holy knights \Ngonna do something about it?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.45,0:00:18.41,main,Warrior 1,0,0,0,,Everyone, run! It's him!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.41,0:00:20.87,main,Warrior 2,0,0,0,,It's that lich, Corpse!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.74,0:00:24.33,main,Fate,0,0,0,,Corpse...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.04,0:00:28.57,italics,Greed,0,0,0,,A warrior named Corpse. I like it.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.24,0:00:30.89,italics,Greed,0,0,0,,You still not done?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.89,0:00:33.34,main,Fate,0,0,0,,I want to get my stats as high as I can
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.34,0:00:35.77,main,Fate,0,0,0,,before the holy knights come after me...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.64,0:02:11.98,sign_harsh_red,Eptitle sign,0,0,0,,{\fade(400,400\blur1)\pos(471.282,285)}Crowned Beast
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.60,0:02:15.74,main,Fate,0,0,0,,Leading a double life isn't easy.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.17,0:02:17.11,main,Roxy,0,0,0,,Fay.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.11,0:02:18.69,main,Fate,0,0,0,,Lady Roxy.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.85,0:02:23.45,main,Roxy,0,0,0,,I have a secret mission for you, Fay.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.20,0:02:26.17,main,Fate,0,0,0,,Is it another inspection?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.50,0:02:30.42,main,Roxy,0,0,0,,You should be able to see it now, Fay.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.89,0:02:32.88,main,Roxy,0,0,0,,That land belongs to the Hart family.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.77,0:02:36.42,main,Roxy,0,0,0,,Isn't it beautiful?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.42,0:02:38.69,main,Fate,0,0,0,,Then this secret mission...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.10,0:02:41.30,main,Fate,0,0,0,,Are we harvesting grapes?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.30,0:02:46.41,main,Roxy,0,0,0,,Do you remember how grapes from our \Nvineyard were on sale at the market?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.41,0:02:50.76,main,Roxy,0,0,0,,I wanted you to see them up close.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.26,0:02:58.15,main,Aisha,0,0,0,,Welcome back, Roxy.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.84,0:02:59.74,main,Roxy,0,0,0,,Mother!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.17,0:03:02.70,main,Roxy,0,0,0,,I told you you didn't have to greet us.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.16,0:03:07.05,main,Aisha,0,0,0,,It's all right. I'm feeling \Nbetter than usual today.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.05,0:03:08.92,main,Roxy,0,0,0,,Please, don't overexert yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.92,0:03:10.92,main,Aisha,0,0,0,,Now, who might this be?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.23,0:03:14.15,main,Roxy,0,0,0,,This is a servant that I hired.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.15,0:03:16.63,main,Roxy,0,0,0,,I brought him to introduce to everyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.63,0:03:19.29,main,Fate,0,0,0,,Uh... It's nice to meet you.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.29,0:03:22.97,main,Fate,0,0,0,,I'm Fate Gra... Graphite.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.09,0:03:27.80,main,Aisha,0,0,0,,I'm Aisha Hart. How nice of you to come.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.80,0:03:30.06,main,Aisha,0,0,0,,You're welcome here, Fate.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.76,0:03:32.52,main,Fate,0,0,0,,Thank you so much.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.52,0:03:34.76,italics,Greed,0,0,0,,That's a relief. She seems nice.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.76,0:03:35.75,italics,Fate,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.75,0:03:37.20,main,Aisha,0,0,0,,I'm wondering, Fate...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.20,0:03:37.98,main,Fate,0,0,0,,Yes?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.03,0:03:49.28,main,Aisha,0,0,0,,Do you like my daughter?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.28,0:03:50.29,main,Roxy,0,0,0,,M-Mother?!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.68,0:03:52.26,italics,Fate,0,0,0,,Right out of the blue?!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.26,0:03:54.73,main,Roxy,0,0,0,,Wh-Why would you ask him that, Mother?!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.73,0:03:59.96,main,Aisha,0,0,0,,I'm just curious about his opinion\N of you, as his employer.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.21,0:04:04.26,italics,Fate,0,0,0,,That's what she meant... She scared me.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.33,0:04:05.84,top,Roxy,0,0,0,,Then you should've said as much!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.84,0:04:06.93,main,Fate,0,0,0,,Madam Aisha.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.89,0:04:11.65,main,Fate,0,0,0,,I care a great deal for Lady Roxy.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.21,0:04:15.77,main,Fate,0,0,0,,And if I were allowed to,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.77,0:04:19.16,main,Fate,0,0,0,,I would like to serve her \Nuntil the end of my life.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.38,0:04:22.77,main,Aisha,0,0,0,,Oh, my!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.14,0:04:30.37,main,Roxy,0,0,0,,I-I'm going to rest for a bit in my room!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.74,0:04:35.29,main,Fate,0,0,0,,Did I say something wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.70,0:04:40.71,main,Aisha,0,0,0,,She always runs off whenever things \Nget uncomfortable. Hasn't changed at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.71,0:04:42.13,main,Fate,0,0,0,,Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.13,0:04:43.26,main,Aisha,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.26,0:04:46.37,main,Aisha,0,0,0,,And when she was little, \Nshe was quite the crybaby.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.37,0:04:48.72,main,Aisha,0,0,0,,She'd throw a fit from \Njust a glimpse of a bug.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.28,0:04:51.54,main,Fate,0,0,0,,I'd never guess that from \Nhow she acts in the capital.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.54,0:04:55.94,main,Aisha,0,0,0,,I still have trouble believing my \Nlittle girl became a holy knight.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.94,0:04:58.77,main,Aisha,0,0,0,,I worry she's pushing herself too hard.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.77,0:05:01.94,main,Aisha,0,0,0,,After losing her father and suddenly \Nbecoming head of the family...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.46,0:05:05.40,main,Fate,0,0,0,,Lady Roxy is a fine holy knight.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.40,0:05:07.87,main,Fate,0,0,0,,The people have a lot of faith in her,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.87,0:05:11.06,main,Fate,0,0,0,,and she performs her duties \Nas head of the house well.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.61,0:05:13.61,main,Aisha,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.37,0:05:45.90,flashback,Mason,0,0,0,,Hold your sword here, and tuck your chin in.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.90,0:05:46.96,flashback,Roxy,0,0,0,,Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.86,0:05:50.43,flashback,Mason,0,0,0,,I never thought you'd \Nbecome a holy knight...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.89,0:05:55.18,flashback,Roxy,0,0,0,,Father, I want to be the kind \Nof holy knight that you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.18,0:05:57.37,flashback,Roxy,0,0,0,,One who laughs along with the people!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.67,0:05:59.73,flashback,Mason,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.84,0:06:02.74,flashback,Mason,0,0,0,,As befits a member of the Hart family.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.74,0:06:03.64,flashback,Roxy,0,0,0,,Right!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.79,0:06:10.49,main,Roxy,0,0,0,,I still haven't fulfilled my promise...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.67,0:06:25.92,main,Farmer 2,0,0,0,,Here. Freshly juiced.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.92,0:06:27.28,main,Farmer 2,0,0,0,,Helps with fatigue.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.28,0:06:28.81,main,Fate,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.62,0:06:35.33,main,Fate,0,0,0,,It's delicious!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.33,0:06:36.73,main,Farmer 2,0,0,0,,Ain't it, though?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.73,0:06:41.04,main,Farmer 2,0,0,0,,The lords have personally helped \Ncultivate this land for generations.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.04,0:06:44.90,main,Farmer 2,0,0,0,,Everyone on the property is proud to \Nhave pitched in to create this flavor.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.23,0:06:47.01,main,Fate,0,0,0,,Even Sir Mason?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.37,0:06:50.98,main,Farmer 2,0,0,0,,I hear he died in Galia.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.44,0:06:54.74,main,Farmer 2,0,0,0,,It must be hard for Lady Roxy...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.61,0:07:00.22,main,Farmer 2,0,0,0,,We weren't sure if she'd show up \Nthis year. We're grateful she did.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.22,0:07:03.93,main,Fate,0,0,0,,Does Lady Roxy help with \Nthe harvest every year?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.93,0:07:05.38,main,Farmer 2,0,0,0,,That's part of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.02,0:07:09.52,main,Farmer 2,0,0,0,,But she comes to hunt monsters, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.52,0:07:10.29,main,Fate,0,0,0,,Monsters?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.29,0:07:14.48,main,Farmer 2,0,0,0,,This is harvest time for most \Ncrops, not just grapes.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.48,0:07:17.37,main,Farmer 2,0,0,0,,And that's when the monsters \Nshow up looking for food.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.02,0:07:22.83,main,Farmer 2,0,0,0,,What we're dealing with, kobolds, \Ncome from that valley in the north.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.83,0:07:24.04,main,Fate,0,0,0,,Kobolds...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.17,0:07:29.22,main,Farmer 2,0,0,0,,Well, you've been working hard! \NMakes sense you'd be hungry.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.47,0:07:32.76,italics,Greed,0,0,0,,After all those goblins, I'm not surprised.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.76,0:07:35.95,italics,Greed,0,0,0,,Your Gluttony skill hungers\Nfor some different souls.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.08,0:07:45.49,main,Roxy,0,0,0,,Fay? Head on back without me, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.49,0:07:47.35,main,Roxy,0,0,0,,I still have things to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.35,0:07:48.69,main,Fate,0,0,0,,Understood.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.46,0:08:08.71,italics,Fate,0,0,0,,She's not from around here.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.35,0:08:14.84,main,Myne,0,0,0,,You there.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.01,0:08:20.90,italics,Fate,0,0,0,,Her eyes... look just like mine!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.65,0:08:25.40,italics,Fate,0,0,0,,Nothing's coming up?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.30,0:08:27.86,main,Myne,0,0,0,,Are you listening?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.86,0:08:30.14,main,Fate,0,0,0,,Oh, did you need something?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.13,0:08:34.03,main,Myne,0,0,0,,Looks like I'm too early.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.03,0:08:34.91,main,Fate,0,0,0,,Early for what?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.12,0:08:38.08,main,Fate,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.57,0:08:41.83,main,Myne,0,0,0,,I came after those kobolds, \Nbut you can have them.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.04,0:08:46.00,main,Myne,0,0,0,,You owe me one. We'll meet again.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.41,0:08:49.77,italics,Fate,0,0,0,,Just who was that, Greed?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.77,0:08:50.85,italics,Greed,0,0,0,,Couldn't tell you.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.85,0:08:52.51,italics,Fate,0,0,0,,You know something, don't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.51,0:08:54.78,italics,Greed,0,0,0,,What makes you think that?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.78,0:08:59.68,italics,Fate,0,0,0,,You always pipe up without me asking, \Nbut you're being awful quiet today.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.68,0:09:02.06,italics,Greed,0,0,0,,Drop the attitude, would you?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.41,0:09:05.53,italics,Greed,0,0,0,,There's some stuff even I, \Nin my greatness, don't know!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.53,0:09:07.32,italics,Fate,0,0,0,,Why do you sound so proud of that?!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.37,0:09:10.70,main,Roxy,0,0,0,,Could you take half of these, Fay?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.70,0:09:13.24,main,Fate,0,0,0,,Lady Roxy, when you said \Nyou had something to do...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.96,0:09:16.49,main,Roxy,0,0,0,,I went to get a share of the grapes.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.49,0:09:19.95,main,Roxy,0,0,0,,She's... a Galian, I believe.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.83,0:09:22.38,main,Fate,0,0,0,,I thought Galia was destroyed.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.38,0:09:24.98,main,Roxy,0,0,0,,That's what they say, yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.41,0:09:29.83,main,Roxy,0,0,0,,Four thousand years ago, Galia\Nwas a great military power...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.83,0:09:34.90,main,Roxy,0,0,0,,But a surge in monsters caused their nation \Nto collapse, and most of their people died.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.80,0:09:37.80,main,Fate,0,0,0,,I guess there were survivors.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.80,0:09:42.56,main,Roxy,0,0,0,,I don't think I've ever seen such \Na full-blooded Galian before, either.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.12,0:09:46.95,main,Roxy,0,0,0,,We should head back as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.78,0:09:56.82,main,Fate,0,0,0,,Lady Roxy... I heard about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.78,0:10:01.67,main,Fate,0,0,0,,This monster hunt...\NWill you be okay on your own?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.50,0:10:04.17,main,Roxy,0,0,0,,I won't be alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.17,0:10:08.51,main,Roxy,0,0,0,,The warriors who work here will be with me.\NAnd I am a holy knight, after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.42,0:10:15.32,main,Roxy,0,0,0,,It won't be a problem!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.29,0:10:22.34,main,Fate,0,0,0,,Oh, this isn't good!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.15,0:10:26.52,main,Farmer 1,0,0,0,,They got us!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.52,0:10:30.39,main,Farmer 3,0,0,0,,Dammit... our grapes...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.94,0:10:33.65,main,Farmer 2,0,0,0,,Those blasted beasts had a feast!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.57,0:10:42.53,main,Fate,0,0,0,,Those are kobolds?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.97,0:10:44.65,main,Roxy,0,0,0,,This task is mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.52,0:10:46.25,main,Soldier 2,0,0,0,,What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.25,0:10:48.26,main,Soldier 1,0,0,0,,There's something else over there...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.31,0:10:55.83,main,Soldier 1,0,0,0,,What the hell is that?!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.83,0:10:58.13,main,Soldier 2,0,0,0,,I've never seen one of that size before!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.53,0:11:02.44,italics,Greed,0,0,0,,If your mouth's watering \Nat just the sight of it, then...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.89,0:11:04.10,italics,Greed,0,0,0,,Time's running out.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.10,0:11:06.04,italics,Fate,0,0,0,,I'm nearly in a starvation state...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.46,0:11:10.92,italics,Fate,0,0,0,,I can't let Lady Roxy see me like that!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.31,0:11:12.76,italics,Fate,0,0,0,,Before it comes to that...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.84,0:11:15.25,italics,Fate,0,0,0,,Level 50?!
