Dialogue: 1,0:11:15.25,0:11:19.24,italics,Greed,0,0,0,,The Bringer of Lamentation, huh? \NIt's a crowned beast.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.24,0:11:20.72,italics,Fate,0,0,0,,Crowned beast?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.72,0:11:25.50,italics,Greed,0,0,0,,It's a powerful monster born from \Naccumulated aggression over a long time.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.50,0:11:27.40,italics,Greed,0,0,0,,Nothing like the usual monsters.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.40,0:11:29.64,italics,Greed,0,0,0,,This is bad news.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.81,0:11:37.41,main,Warrior 5,0,0,0,,We don't stand a chance against that thing!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.41,0:11:38.74,main,Warrior 6,0,0,0,,What do we do?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.13,0:11:42.47,main,Roxy,0,0,0,,There's no need to worry. I will slay it.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.47,0:11:44.33,main,Roxy,0,0,0,,I'm a holy knight.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.33,0:11:48.97,main,Roxy,0,0,0,,And I will dedicate all of my power to \Nprotecting this land and all of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.64,0:11:50.96,main,Unmarked Crowd,0,0,0,,Lady Roxy!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.96,0:11:54.10,main,Roxy,0,0,0,,I ask for you workers to get to safety...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.74,0:11:54.10,italicstop,Greed,0,0,0,,She can't manage this on her own.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.10,0:11:56.52,main,Roxy,0,0,0,,Warriors, prepare for battle.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.10,0:11:56.52,italicstop,Greed,0,0,0,,That thing's too much \Nfor such a young holy knight.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.23,0:11:59.50,main,Warrior 6,0,0,0,,If we're going to be \Nfully outfitted for battle,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.50,0:12:02.28,main,Warrior 6,0,0,0,,we'll need until tomorrow to be ready.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.28,0:12:04.80,main,Roxy,0,0,0,,That's fine. Please, do everything you can.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.80,0:12:05.56,main,Warrior 6,0,0,0,,Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.26,0:12:08.91,italics,Greed,0,0,0,,What now, Fate?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.91,0:12:13.62,italics,Fate,0,0,0,,A monster at level 50 is too much \Nfor me at the moment.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.62,0:12:16.94,italics,Fate,0,0,0,,But... I can't ignore them...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.20,0:12:21.24,italics,Fate,0,0,0,,And I can't ignore what's \Nhappening in the Hart's lands.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.68,0:12:23.05,italics,Fate,0,0,0,,Besides...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.01,0:12:30.02,italics,Fate,0,0,0,,I will not let Lady Roxy die.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.37,0:12:32.06,italics,Fate,0,0,0,,We're doing this, Greed!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.80,0:12:41.01,italics,Greed,0,0,0,,Again with the hero act? \NYou must be really into it.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.01,0:12:42.02,main,Fate,0,0,0,,Shut up!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.97,0:12:46.47,italics,Greed,0,0,0,,Those are kobold warriors \Naround the crowned beast.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.47,0:12:48.37,italics,Greed,0,0,0,,The others are probably all kobold juniors.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.84,0:12:50.69,italics,Greed,0,0,0,,You got any kinda plan, here?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.03,0:12:53.08,main,Fate,0,0,0,,I'm going to fight like a glutton.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.64,0:13:07.85,italics,Voice,0,0,0,,Gluttony skill has activated.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.98,0:13:14.94,italics,Voice,0,0,0,,Gluttony skill has activated.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.76,0:13:47.29,italics,Voice,0,0,0,,Gluttony skill has activated.
