Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.73,0:13:51.62,italics,Fate,0,0,0,,Still not enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.77,0:14:00.03,italics,Voice,0,0,0,,Gluttony skill has activated.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.02,0:14:11.40,italics,Voice,0,0,0,,Gluttony skill has activated.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.40,0:14:12.83,italics,Greed,0,0,0,,Looks like this is over.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.12,0:14:16.31,main,Fate,0,0,0,,He caught them?!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.09,0:14:21.17,italics,Greed,0,0,0,,We'll have to get in close and carve him up.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.17,0:14:22.17,main,Fate,0,0,0,,Right!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.61,0:14:30.93,italics,Greed,0,0,0,,That's an art from the \NBrawl skill, Ruinous Strike!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.93,0:14:34.38,italics,Greed,0,0,0,,It can penetrate armor to \Nshatter bone and pulverize organs!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.38,0:14:35.14,italics,Greed,0,0,0,,Watch out!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.91,0:14:53.65,italics,Greed,0,0,0,,Snap out of it, Fate!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.25,0:15:05.38,italics,Greed,0,0,0,,Pretending to be out cold?\NThat's a pretty slick trick you've learned.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.60,0:15:12.65,main,Fate,0,0,0,,Dammit!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.60,0:15:19.07,italics,Voice,0,0,0,,Gluttony skill has activated.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.94,0:15:24.11,italics,Greed,0,0,0,,You should be able to use \Nmy first-level hidden art now!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.11,0:15:26.73,italics,Greed,0,0,0,,I'll need 10% of your current stats!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.73,0:15:28.33,italics,Greed,0,0,0,,We'll put a quick end to this!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.33,0:15:29.90,main,Fate,0,0,0,,Okay! Take it!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.34,0:15:51.26,italics,Greed,0,0,0,,Fire away, Fate! Bloody Ptarmigan!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.94,0:16:12.17,italics,Greed,0,0,0,,Looks like that health regen skill \Nyou took from the goblin king
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.17,0:16:14.28,italics,Greed,0,0,0,,has already healed you up, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.87,0:16:16.31,main,Fate,0,0,0,,Hey, Greed...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.31,0:16:17.41,italics,Greed,0,0,0,,What's up?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.41,0:16:19.35,main,Fate,0,0,0,,That was overkill!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.35,0:16:20.41,italics,Greed,0,0,0,,You think so?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.41,0:16:22.88,italics,Voice,0,0,0,,Gluttony skill has activated.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.68,0:16:28.48,main,Fate,0,0,0,,Wh-What is this... frenzy...?!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.23,0:16:32.41,italics,Greed,0,0,0,,Aw, dammit.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.41,0:16:35.19,italics,Greed,0,0,0,,You're overloaded from devouring \Na soul of higher quality for the first time.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.77,0:16:37.63,italics,Greed,0,0,0,,Fate, hold it in!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.63,0:16:40.67,italics,Greed,0,0,0,,If you don't, it'll be even \Nworse than a starvation state!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.32,0:16:55.66,main,Warrior,0,0,0,,Sword and arrow wounds...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.66,0:16:58.37,main,Roxy,0,0,0,,Were these caused by magic arrows?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.14,0:17:03.07,main,Roxy,0,0,0,,Who could've done this?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.25,0:17:12.46,main,Roxy,0,0,0,,All that beautiful scenery \Nwas torn to shreds...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.09,0:17:15.55,italics,Fate,0,0,0,,Sorry about that, everyone!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.55,0:17:17.80,main,Aisha,0,0,0,,Who could've done such a thing?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.80,0:17:21.75,main,Roxy,0,0,0,,I saw a Galian girl the other day...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.75,0:17:26.04,main,Roxy,0,0,0,,They're said to be even more \Npowerful than holy knights.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.04,0:17:27.15,main,Roxy,0,0,0,,Maybe it was her?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.61,0:17:31.22,main,Roxy,0,0,0,,But regardless, we can rest easy now.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.22,0:17:32.07,main,Fate,0,0,0,,Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.07,0:17:33.78,top,Roxy,0,0,0,,Let's return to the capital.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.52,0:17:36.98,italics,Aisha,0,0,0,,When she's around Fate...\Nshe makes the most wonderful face.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.75,0:17:41.74,main,Aisha,0,0,0,,Fate, I have a favor to ask of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.14,0:17:45.80,main,Aisha,0,0,0,,I'd like you to stay at my \Ndaughter's side, to support her.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.42,0:17:49.90,main,Fate,0,0,0,,But... someone like me couldn't possibly...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.13,0:17:53.71,main,Aisha,0,0,0,,I'm not asking you to \Nhave prestige or authority...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.13,0:17:56.50,main,Aisha,0,0,0,,Or strength, like a holy knight.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.93,0:17:59.43,main,Aisha,0,0,0,,What makes you valuable is in here.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.04,0:18:02.27,main,Aisha,0,0,0,,The desire to help her.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.27,0:18:04.10,main,Fate,0,0,0,,Heart...?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.09,0:18:08.30,main,Aisha,0,0,0,,Yes. After all, that's how it was for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.61,0:18:11.06,main,Aisha,0,0,0,,I was of common birth, \Nwith no skill to speak of...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.83,0:18:15.00,main,Aisha,0,0,0,,But I was still able to support my husband.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.70,0:18:22.20,main,Aisha,0,0,0,,I believe having only a single holy knight \Nparent has caused Roxy some difficulty.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.33,0:18:24.59,main,Fate,0,0,0,,Madam Aisha!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.67,0:18:28.90,main,Aisha,0,0,0,,I'm not long for this world.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.26,0:18:32.38,main,Aisha,0,0,0,,Which is why... I want you \Nto be there for her...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.84,0:18:35.26,main,Aisha,0,0,0,,Support Roxy, in my place.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.27,0:18:36.26,main,Aisha,0,0,0,,Please.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.79,0:18:40.29,main,Aisha,0,0,0,,I understand if you can't answer right away.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.29,0:18:42.74,main,Aisha,0,0,0,,But... I ask you to consider it.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.64,0:18:44.69,main,Aisha,0,0,0,,All right?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.08,0:18:48.09,main,Fate,0,0,0,,Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.77,0:18:57.07,italics,Fate,0,0,0,,Am I worthy of something like that?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.67,0:18:59.90,italics,Fate,0,0,0,,When I'm deceiving the world...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.18,0:19:08.20,italics,Fate,0,0,0,,And carrying a secret like the Gluttony skill.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.61,0:19:11.84,main,Fate,0,0,0,,Why?!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.63,0:19:16.63,italics,Greed,0,0,0,,I told you. Goblins won't cut it anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.63,0:19:20.73,main,Fate,0,0,0,,But there are no stronger monsters \Nthan goblins around here!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.73,0:19:24.93,italics,Greed,0,0,0,,Time's running out, Fate. You need \Nto decide what comes next.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.52,0:19:33.65,main,Barkeep,0,0,0,,Really? That's remarkable.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.98,0:19:38.20,italics,Fate,0,0,0,,I really don't have the right \Nto stand at Lady Roxy's side.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.69,0:19:44.42,main,Ad,0,0,0,,You hear the news? Sir Hado's going to \Nbe joining the hunt for Corpse.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.42,0:19:45.62,main,Fate,0,0,0,,Hado?!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.62,0:19:50.00,main,Barkeep,0,0,0,,Probably his way of getting some \Nglory with an easy assignment.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.77,0:19:54.68,main,Ad,0,0,0,,They should send his ass to Galia, \Nwhere he can be monster food!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.68,0:19:58.75,main,Barkeep,0,0,0,,People like him always \Nstick to where it's safest.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.75,0:20:01.93,main,Barkeep,0,0,0,,Someone else is going to end up \Non the Galia expedition.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.20,0:20:03.98,main,Fate,0,0,0,,An expedition to Galia?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.98,0:20:07.05,main,Fate,0,0,0,,Again? So soon after Sir Mason's death?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.05,0:20:08.87,main,Ad,0,0,0,,It's gonna be settled on soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.39,0:20:12.85,main,Ad,0,0,0,,I just hope the worst-case \Nscenario doesn't come true...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.77,0:20:31.20,main,Roxy,0,0,0,,Father.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.04,0:20:34.50,main,Roxy,0,0,0,,I've been assigned to \Nthe expedition to Galia.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.15,0:20:36.92,main,Roxy,0,0,0,,Please, watch over me.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.92,0:20:38.19,main,Fate,0,0,0,,Please, don't do this.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.19,0:20:39.21,main,Roxy,0,0,0,,Fay?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.94,0:20:42.09,main,Fate,0,0,0,,Please don't go to Galia.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.09,0:20:45.48,main,Fate,0,0,0,,If you go now... you might not come back.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.68,0:20:50.56,main,Roxy,0,0,0,,I've decided to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.50,0:20:55.98,main,Fate,0,0,0,,Lady Roxy...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.79,0:21:03.53,flashback italics,Ad,0,0,0,,The Hart family is a nuisance \Nfor the Vlericks and other holy knights.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.53,0:21:06.72,flashback italics,Ad,0,0,0,,Rumor has it they arranged \Nfor this expedition to Galia, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.72,0:21:07.82,main,Fate,0,0,0,,Dammit!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.16,0:21:12.15,main,Memil,0,0,0,,And now we'll finally be rid of that nuisance.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.15,0:21:14.37,main,Memil,0,0,0,,You can handle the rest, Hado.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.37,0:21:18.11,main,Hado,0,0,0,,And the two of you are off to \NTenbern, eh? Wish I was going, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.11,0:21:21.21,main,Memil,0,0,0,,This isn't just fun for us. \NIt's a research trip.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.21,0:21:23.05,main,Memil,0,0,0,,Isn't that right, Rafale?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.05,0:21:25.18,main,Hado,0,0,0,,Your research into "immortality," right?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.66,0:21:29.88,main,Hado,0,0,0,,I'm your little brother. Isn't it \Nabout time you told me the truth?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.88,0:21:31.28,main,Hado,0,0,0,,How about it, brother?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.28,0:21:34.64,main,Rafale,0,0,0,,I'm counting on you to \Ndeal with this lich, Hado.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.72,0:21:40.76,italics,Fate,0,0,0,,I can't overturn official orders.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.69,0:21:43.96,italics,Fate,0,0,0,,And I can't stop Lady Roxy.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.85,0:21:45.70,italics,Fate,0,0,0,,But...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.27,0:21:52.50,italics,Fate,0,0,0,,I won't let them treat people \Nlike trash and cause suffering!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.10,0:21:54.89,main,Hado,0,0,0,,You must be Corpse.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:35.64,0:23:40.02,sign_harsh_red,Greed/Eptitle sign,0,0,0,,{\fade(400,1)\3c&H000100&\fs30\blur1\pos(320,150)}To Galia
Dialogue: 0,0:23:36.37,0:23:37.64,italics,Greed/Eptitle sign,0,0,0,,"To Galia."
